      "pot": {
        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # Define variables name and value\n    net_worth = 1_200_000\n    tax_brackets = [\n        (500_000, 0.00),\n        (1_000_000, 0.02),\n        (1_200_000, 0.04),\n    ]\n    residency_factor = 0.9\n\n    # Do math calculation to get the answer\n    total_tax = 0\n    previous_threshold = 0\n\n    for threshold, rate in tax_brackets:\n        if net_worth > threshold:\n            total_tax += (threshold - previous_threshold) * rate\n            previous_threshold = threshold\n        else:\n            total_tax += (net_worth - previous_threshold) * rate\n            break\n\n    adjusted_tax = total_tax * residency_factor\n\n    # Return the answer rounded to the nearest integer\n    return round(adjusted_tax)\n```",
